mintcam (0.8.1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Critical fix: ffmpeg command indices were wrong in _start_with_audio(),
    corrupting the video input pipe:0 and causing a BrokenPipeError, which
    resulted in silent audio in all recordings on PulseAudio systems.
  * Fix motion detection auto-stop: recording would immediately stop when
    started manually while motion detection was enabled, because the timer
    was initialized to 0.0.
  * Fix audio level meter overlapping with REC indicator text.
  * Fix audio device enumeration (pactl JSON API uses lowercase keys).

 -- Alex Mirici <jeaders@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 18 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

mintcam (0.8.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Audio recording fix for Linux Mint XFCE: detect PulseAudio via pactl and
    use @DEFAULT_SOURCE@ instead of hardcoding ALSA "default", which silently
    captures silence on systems with the PulseAudio/ALSA shim.
  * Audio device selection: users can now pick a specific microphone from the
    General settings card instead of always using the default.
  * Check for updates button: queries the GitHub releases API and shows a
    dialog with a link when a newer version is available.
  * Fixed stale maintainer email in packaging metadata.

  -- Alex Mirici <jeaders@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:30:00 +0200

mintcam (0.7.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Language selection: Italian and English, pickable from the General card and
    remembered between sessions. The interface was written in Italian and every
    user-facing string is now translated through the Qt translation system, so
    adding French, Spanish or German later only needs a new translation file
    listed in app/i18n.py, with no change to the application code.
  * The compiled translations ship in the package under
    /usr/share/mintcam/i18n, and the source .ts files stay in the repository so
    they can be edited with Qt Linguist and recompiled with lrelease.
  * Focus assist and face auto-framing fixes from the previous release are
    included; see 0.6.0.

  -- Alex Mirici <jeaders@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:05:00 +0200

